.TH V2_DIST 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
v2_dist \- Distance between two points: v2_len(v2_sub(a, b))
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqmathx.h\(dq
.BI "float v2_dist(Vec2 a, Vec2 b);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Distance between two points: v2_len(v2_sub(a, b)). Range checks, pickup radius, "is the player near the door". For a circle\-vs\-circle test use circle_overlaps(), which avoids the square root.
.PP
This is a static inline function; it is defined in the header.
.SH RETURN VALUE
the distance.
.SH MODULE
math (src/engine/math/mathx.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR v2_len (3),
.BR circle_overlaps (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
